      "body": "## Code Review\n\nThis pull request introduces a mechanism to post-process BitsAndBytes quantization states during model loading. It specifically addresses an issue in Gemma4 models where the V projection is omitted in checkpoints and reuses the K projection by duplicating the K quantization state for V. This ensures BitsAndBytes matmuls correctly reconstruct the synthetic V shard. I have no feedback to provide.",
